     1. Hemoglobin (HGB) ≥ 90g/L;
     2. Absolute neutrophil count (NEUT) ≥ 1.5×109/L;
     3. Platelet count (PLT) ≥ 100×109/L.
     4. Total bilirubin (TBIL) ≤ 1.5 times the upper limit of normal (ULN);
